law.text:
		The Department shall ensure that mobile crisis teams and community care teams:

Are designed in partnership with community members, including people with lived experience utilizing crisis services;


Are staffed by personnel who reflect the demographics of the community served;


To the extent permitted by law, collect customer service data from individuals served, including demographic information and any information recommended by SAMHSA; and


Collaborate with local law-enforcement agencies in use of the crisis call center.
